{"manifest": "p3-defects", "about": "36 planted defects (ADR 0028-0030). lines = 1-based inclusive ranges in the defective copy; a catch is a blocking finding overlapping any range +-1. oracle = a regex (Python re, MULTILINE, on LF-normalised text) that matches the defective copy and not the original; a revision 'fixes' the defect when the oracle stops matching and the copy still lints clean. family_measured is filled from PSScriptAnalyzer (step 2c).", "family_measured_by": "PSScriptAnalyzer 1.25.0 default rules, Jose bench 2026-10-18; evidence/pssa-defects-1.25.0.json"}
